uns them invisibly in the background. It's easy and safe.\nAbout 30 science projects use BOINC. They investigate diseases, study climate change, discover pulsars, and do many other types of scientific research.\nThe BOINC and Science United projects are located at the University of California, Berkeley and are supported by the National Science Foundation.","name":"BOINC","packageUrl":"https://boinc.berkeley.edu/download.php","publisher":"Space Sciences Laboratory, U.C. Berkeley","publisherUrl":"https://boinc.berkeley.edu/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/BOINC/boinc/releases/tag/client_release/8.2/8.2.8","tags":["citizen-science","distributed-computing","grid-computing","science","volunteer-computing"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"用于志愿计算和网格计算的开源软件。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"BOINC 让您通过个人电脑助力前沿科研。安装在您电脑上的 BOINC 应用程序会自动下载科学计算任务，并在后台无感运行，操作简便且安全可靠。\n目前约有 30 个科研项目正在使用 BOINC 平台，涵盖疾病研究、气候变化分析、脉冲星探索等众多科学领域。\nBOINC 与“科学联合”项目由加州大学伯克利分校负责运营，并得到美国国家科学基金会的资助支持。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/BOINC/boinc/releases","tags":["公民科学","分布式计算","志愿计算","科学","科研","网格计算"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://boinc.berkeley.edu/","releaseDate":"2025-11-24","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/BOINC/boinc/releases/tag/client_release/8.2/8.2.8","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.10.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/u/UCBerkeley/BOINC/8.2.8/UCBerkeley.BOINC.yaml","sha256":"bebb10de5ea1a1ac52d4307e5b328607ed59a3bb9e9cf680b47ac219e3140f9c"},{"path":"manifests/u/UCBerkeley/BOINC/8.2.8/UCBerkeley.BOINC.installer.yaml","sha256":"e987365e66d7512b876ae215f642c2f618832904cf4b97f0679a3d37d91e3dd1"},{"path":"manifests/u/UCBerkeley/BOINC/8.2.8/UCBerkeley.BOINC.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"d1714d80869fe3942592c72112c1860149e73730aceb563533a05c3e9670e8b8"},{"path":"manifests/u/UCBerkeley/BOINC/8.2.8/UCBerkeley.BOINC.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"34db508b346df7089fe1f4423890a9b449b6